<th>题号</th>
<th>考点</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>2024</td>
<td>20, 21</td>
<td>中断响应、DMA计算</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2023</td>
<td>20, 21</td>
<td>DMA方式、中断向量</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2022</td>
<td>20, 21, 44</td>
<td>中断系统、I/O方式比较、I/O大题</td>
</tr>
<tr>
